        <div class="post-detail__content">
          <p>The Mission Statement of the Teton Valley Museum is: “Preserve and share the history and dreams of the early pioneers in the valley we love.”&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>

<p>The action of this Mission Statement involves many hours of volunteer work. Volunteers are instrumental in gathering, inputting, and preserving the historical data of the early pioneers and settlers of the Teton Valley.</p>

<p>Teton Valley Museum depends immensely on the wonderful and much-needed donations of participants of the Tin Cup event.&nbsp;</p>

<p>The culmination of many hours of work and much needed funding results in a wonderful experience of touring the Teton Valley Museum.&nbsp;</p>

<p>We encourage all who are interested to donate through the Tin Cup drive on behalf of the Teton Valley Museum. Please feel free to visit the Teton Valley Museum for a wonderful tour through Teton Valley history.&nbsp;</p>
